F6: [[thm-fourier-basis-and-parseval-on-the-n-torus]]: the Fourier coefficient
map is a surjective isometry from complex $L^2$ onto $\ell^2(\mathbb Z^3)$;
real-valued inputs have conjugate-symmetric coefficients.

F4: [[prop-christoffel-formula-for-the-levi-civita-connection]]: in a chart,
$\Gamma^k{}_{ij}=\tfrac12\widetilde h^{k\ell}(\partial_i\widetilde h_{j\ell}
+\partial_j\widetilde h_{i\ell}-\partial_\ell\widetilde h_{ij})$.
